                "type": "text",
                "text": "At first, the late deliveries seemed like a small issue, but they were just the tip of the iceberg. When we tried to get to the bottom of it, we opened a can of worms: the supplier had problems with staff and software. A quick fix wasn't enough, so we ironed out a new contract. Now we're back on track — and the change was a blessing in disguise, because the new supplier is cheaper.",
